#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Each of the lines beginning I<tfd> describes one of the file descriptors "
"being monitored via the epoll file descriptor (see B<epoll_ctl>(2)  for some "
