msgid ""
"Interpret escape sequences directly, instead of asking B<ncurses> to "
"translate them.  (If you need this option to get some keys to work properly, "
"it means that the B<terminfo> terminal description that is used does not "
"fully match the actual behavior of your terminal.  This can happen when you "
"ssh into a BSD machine, for example.)  Using this option disables B<nano>'s "
"mouse support."
msgstr ""
