msgid ""
"Note - the linker will delete the output file before it starts to write to "
"it.  It will do this even if it turns out that the link cannot be completed "
"due to errors."
msgstr ""

#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
